   262	    """Fingerprint of the script plus the effective bytes to snapshot. Inline
   263	    ``script`` text wins over ``scriptPath``; an unreadable ``scriptPath`` is
   264	    recorded (no hash, no snapshot) — the guard then reports INCONCLUSIVE."""
   265	    script = tool_input.get("script")
